Package: marlinspike-agent
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), openssl
Maintainer: MarlinSpike Project <noreply@localhost>
Description: Remote sensor agent for MarlinSpike fleet management
 Enrolls with a central MarlinSpike fleet gateway over TLS and maintains
 an authenticated heartbeat connection. Relays live-capture control to a
 local capd sidecar and ships analysis reports back to the central
 console. Zero third-party Python dependencies (stdlib ssl/asyncio only).
